           awake§r✮§r
#- §4MissPortinari sat up and looked around 
the dark room, heart pounding. In a moment her eyes adjusted.  

She was alone, everything was 
where it should be. 

Mushroom on the shelf, framed pic of Queen on the 
bedside table.§r
#- §4She wiped the sweat from her face. 

The dreams 
were back.  

They had subsided for a while, but 
with the recent disappearence of§r Enocori...

§o§4§othey were back.§r
#- §4She fumbled for 
the drawer of her bedside table, reaching in for a bottle of water, and the vial of pills with Dr. Link's name on the label. She finally forced herself out of bed, and across the small room. Drawing back the curtain, she hesitated a moment, before lifting her§r
#- §4eyes to look out 
into her office.

It was empty, night time, just the hum of the lights, the AC, the security cameras.

She stepped carefully around her desk and walked silently on the thick carpet to the window. Put her hand to the pane as if to§r
#- §4make sure it really was still there. Below the city buzzed with energy in the darkness. Things were afoot... things were always afoot, but this was different. 

These dreams were different -- what did it all mean?  

§oThey were too real.§r§r 
#- §4And with that uncomfortable feeling, like looking at very old photographs, 
of a time you'd 
rather forget...

Her eyes traced the skyline. It was so beautiful here.  Everything they'd made. Would you do anything for it? Yes.  She smiled.§r
#- §4She was in love with these rooms and corridors. With this vessel we shall sail through the darkness, like a camel through the desert. She allowed herself a moment to indulge in the sentiment. 
Well, she thought... nap time's over. Still lots of work to do before morning...§r
#- §k0010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110§r
§8{written by
           MissPortinari}§r
§k01100010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110001011000101100010110§r
#- §6The dreams....
§r
§5You dream about 
such things, the life you lived, live and will live.§r

§6Yes, I think so... visions in the fog.§r

§5Change if you must. Escape you will not.§r

§6§lWHO ARE YOU!?§r§§  
