§2{by Link-125}§r
#- §2The sonar findings under Deathcap Island have yielded a surprising discovery.  
A long buried alien spacecraft of unknown origin and date was found deep in the earth.  

Immediate construction of a suitable holding bay was started.§r
#- §2The paranormal reserach opportunities 
continue to fuel our imaginations and studies.  

Very promising research into vampirism has given 
us hope that many bloodborn illnesses can be cured with further study.§r
#- §2The creatures have been contained in a suitable chamber and kept in stasis while we experiment. 

Additional funding was provided for the study of mummies and
werewolves, both classic subjects for research.§r

§6This is not a story!§r§r
#- §2The ghost lab has made great strides 
in capturing and containing ghosts of many varieties for examination.

As time and funds permit, we will expand our scope to include other paranormal entities.§r

§5You should read this...§r
#- §2Deathcap Island 
has such beings as witches, dragons, demons, sentient mold, bots, gnomes, and goblins just to name 
a few current and future study subjects.§r

§6Huh? They want to study us?§r

§5And who are 'they'?§r
#- §2Our lab has partnered with the insane asylum just off the shores of Deathcap Island. 
Dr. Link is head of the board of trustees.  Some of her most guarded experiments are conducted there away from the prying eyes of governmental and humanitarian authorities.§r
#- §6What the heck!?§r

§5Told you it's 
a good read...§r

§2Dr. Link has provided information about a secret way into her personal laboratory inside the asylum. Hopefully this will gain less attention from other members of 
the Deathcap team.§r
#- §2There is an old ruin that was once an observatory, just North of The Spyglass Tavern and The Sinkhole, over the bridge. She has provided a button that opens a tunnel inside. 

{The drop is safe}§r

§6Well I know where we are going after this...§r
#- §4𝗔𝗖𝗖𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗧𝗥𝗜𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡:
𝗨𝗻𝗮𝘂𝘁𝗵𝗼𝗿𝗶𝘇𝗲𝗱 𝗮𝗰𝗰𝗲𝘀𝘀 𝗶𝗻𝘁𝗼 
𝗗𝗿. 𝗟𝗶𝗻𝗸'𝘀 𝗟𝗮𝗯𝗼𝗿𝗮𝘁𝗼𝗿𝘆 𝗶𝘀 𝗽𝘂𝗻𝗶𝘀𝗵𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗯𝘆 𝗹𝗮𝘄 𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗲𝗿 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗘𝘀𝗽𝗶𝗼𝗻𝗮𝗴𝗲 𝗔𝗰𝘁 (𝗖𝗿𝗮𝗳𝘁𝗮𝗱𝗶𝗮 𝗖𝗼𝗱𝗲 𝟲𝟲𝟲). 𝗢𝗻𝗹𝘆 𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗶𝘃𝗶𝗱𝘂𝗮𝗹𝘀 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗮𝗽𝗽𝗿𝗼𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝘀𝗲𝗰𝘂𝗿𝗶𝘁𝘆 𝗰𝗹𝗲𝗮𝗿𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲 𝗹𝗲𝘃𝗲𝗹𝘀 𝗮𝗿𝗲 𝗽𝗿𝗲𝗺𝗶𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗱 𝗮𝗰𝗰𝗲𝘀𝘀. 

𝗔𝗻𝘆𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗳𝗼𝘂𝗻𝗱 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵𝗼𝘂𝘁 𝘀𝗵𝗮𝗹𝗹 𝗯𝗲 𝘀𝗵𝗼𝘁 𝗼𝗻 𝘀𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁.§r

