        §8A Lantern!§r
     §8 {by Enocori}§r
 ╚═--═ஓ๑☠๑ஓ═--═╝

§8Through a dreary town illuminated at night, across the dark expanses every house is known. 

A lantern sits tall and bright with a calm and mellowing tone.§r 
#- 

§8Laughter loud and cheering to be heard across these hallowed streets. 

Yet not a whisper of the absurd that scares the children under their sheets.§r
#- 


§8A boy has again gone missing, a girl who will never be found.

Inside their homes a lantern hissing but to the family such a comforting sound.§r
#- 

§8The festivities have dulled away and no more does joy echo through the mist. 

This town all alone will slowly decay if they let these horrors persist.§r
#- §8With many lost, few remain the thoughts of luck leave their ego swollen. Finding comfort with body pressed against its pane...

Another soul now stolen.§...
